# Co-op impassable terrain block: one 10 m map cell of solid rock. The Game layer spawns one per
# blocked cell of the generated co-op map (seeded noise + carved lanes, see GameMatch), sunk a
# random depth so the exposed height varies (spawn y = exposed - 5). Blocks everyone (Default
# layer): players, units and projectiles all collide; also a Nav obstacle and a placement-blocked
# footprint (StructureSystem terrain rects).
Prefab gameRock
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.32 0.3 0.29
		Scale 5
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 5 5 5
		Friction 0.8
